<title>FRANCE: Camdessus says major currencies at better levels.</title>
<headline>Camdessus says major currencies at better levels.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>International Monetary Fund chief Michel Camdessus said on Wednesday that the world's major currencies were at better levels and that he hoped this would last.</p>
<p>&quot;The major currencies are now in a better constellation and we all hope this will continue,&quot; Camdessus told a conference.</p>
<p>(( -- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452))</p>
